  "content": "<h5><img src=\"https://github.com/LunaPixelStudios/Fear-Nightfall/blob/main/banner.png?raw=true\" width=\"1730\" height=\"808\"></h5><h5><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.vivecraft.org%252fhow-to-play%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=Виртуальная реальность&amp;message=Как играть?&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=8c4c33&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Oculus&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"295\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fwiki%252fserver_setup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=Голосовой чат&amp;message=Как настроить?&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=8c4c33&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=teamspeak&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"268\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"lunapixel.studio/discord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=8c4c33&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"221\" height=\"30\"></a></h5><h5><img src=\"https://github.com/LunaPixelStudios/Fear-Nightfall/blob/main/1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Уникальный, погружающий и сложный хоррор-опыт. С большим количеством пользовательского контента, индивидуальным финальным боссом и шейдером, созданным специально для модпака. Также попробуйте в VR!\" width=\"1669\" height=\"1996\"></h5><p><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xz1N5_YNtKA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"405\" height=\"227\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1g9S0InRmXA\" width=\"405\" height=\"227\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CDBHeMk0OxE\" width=\"405\" height=\"227\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DhGKK4x3aUM\" width=\"405\" height=\"227\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RBnG7hII0cI?t=5s&amp;pp=ygUSbHVuYSBwaXhlbCBzdHVkaW9z\" width=\"810\" height=\"472\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<strong>Если у вас возникли проблемы с авторскими правами на ваши видео, лицензии/кредиты можно найти здесь</strong></span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eerie-music-forge-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Eerie Music</strong></a><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/scary-music\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Scary Music</strong></a></h5>",
